    "details": "<p><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"137\">Two weeks. Build something useful. Ship it to BOSS Console.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"42018e89-b8dc-47f0-84c9-f5aa3e2a66bd\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"fbskMG_root markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\n<p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"345\">BOSS Contributor Hackathon is an open-source contribution sprint for developers who want to build, fix, improve, and ship meaningful work to BossConsole, an Apache-2.0, multi-platform harness for AI agents.</p>\n<p data-section-id=\"p2ihs1\" data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"364\"><strong>What to Build</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"544\">\n<li data-section-id=\"4uwppl\" data-start=\"366\" data-end=\"544\">\n<p>Pick a useful issue, improvement, integration, UI fix, agent workflow, developer-experience upgrade, or documentation contribution that makes BossConsole better for real users.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"16w64e5\" data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"568\"><strong>Prize Pool:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1st place: $500.</li>\n<li>2nd place: $300.</li>\n<li>3rd place: $200.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"1d5devt\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"650\"><strong>What We Will Judge</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quality.</li>\n<li>Usefulness.</li>\n<li>Relevance.</li>\n<li>Originality.</li>\n<li>Ownership of your contribution.</li>\n<li>AI-assisted development is allowed, but the contribution should still show clear thinking and real effort.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"pfmop0\" data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"872\"><strong>What Will Not Count</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spam PRs.</li>\n<li>Duplicated submissions.</li>\n<li>Low-effort changes.</li>\n<li>Irrelevant contributions.</li>\n<li>Copied work will not be rewarded.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"9ucpt7\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1246\"><strong>Eligibility</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to students, freshers, professionals, and open-source contributors.</li>\n<li>Participants should have a GitHub profile and be able to submit a meaningful contribution to the repository.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
